{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579390/extras/DFTS.png?t=1745330316\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Bullet Heaven Roguelike About Breaking Free</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This isn't just a game\u2014it's a raw, unfiltered scream against the soul-crushing grind of minimum wage work and the suffocating corporate machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you ever feel like it\u2019s all too much? Like the game is rigged from the start? Your &quot;manager&quot; is lording over you for being three minutes late, your job is a cycle of mindless tasks, and life is slipping through your fingers. <strong>Welcome to your breaking point.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579390/extras/LiveThePsychoticBreak.png?t=1745330316\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Don't Forget to Smile</strong> is a fast-paced survivors-like bullet heaven where you fight through relentless waves of everyday enemies.\u00a0Armed with weapons inspired by - and mocking - industry, health and safety and technology, you\u2019ll gear up, level up and reach your breaking point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579390/extras/Arsenal.png?t=1745330316\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022 10+ Weapons</strong> to unlock, forged from the tools of industry and oppression.<br>\u2022\u00a0<strong>15+ Augments</strong>\u00a0to unlock, infused with industrial tech and medicine.<br>\u2022\u00a0<strong>Upgrade Shop</strong> (No, not real money! No microtransactions here)<br>\u2022\u00a0<strong>Hidden Synergies</strong> between weapons and augments unleash devastating effects.<br>\u2022\u00a0<strong>5+ Levels</strong> depicting the bleak reality we inhabit.<br>\u2022\u00a0<strong>A Satirical Take</strong> on corporate culture, mental health, and the human condition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579390/extras/Therapy.png?t=1745330316\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work your way up and out of the corporate ladder, smearing your oppressors across the screen as you shoot, stun, electrify, burn, explode, slap and squash your way to the good life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All brought to life through <strong>a unique blend of hand-drawn artwork, 3D renders, and 2D animation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579390/extras/ActiveDevelopment.png?t=1745330316\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022 Steam Achievements - Framework built, ready to hook to Steam.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022 Controller Support - Now Implemented</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022<strong> Localisations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022 Leaderboards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022 More Weapons &amp; Augments - Got an idea? Tell us!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579390/extras/JoinTheCause.png?t=1745330316\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want in early? <strong>Join the rebellion.</strong> Get involved with private playtesting and discussions by reaching out to our social channels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579390/extras/devNOtes.png?t=1745330316\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hello! I'm Jamie and I am a solo dev - along with my trusty sound guy Frank, of course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We're working on this in our spare time, alongside family and work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We're committed to releasing a game that you enjoy. Not a cash grab, not a buggy mess, and not rushed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your following, wishlisting and sharing of this game is greatly appreciated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3579390?t=1745330316","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579390/b5f0d2079be1bdf7add9c30b8087fbb053376eef/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745330316","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579390/5c17cccfb3844708196e0fb639cce5da6adfa3d1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745330316","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579390/5c17cccfb3844708196e0fb639cce5da6adfa3d1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745330316","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Don't Forget to Smile revolves around the player breaking out of their day to day in a wave of violence. Enemies are killed through guns and explosives and their deaths are presented in a stylised, bloody way."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579390/extras/DFTS.png?t=1745330316\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Bullet Heaven Roguelike About Breaking Free</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This isn't just a game\u2014it's a raw, unfiltered scream against the soul-crushing grind of minimum wage work and the suffocating corporate machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you ever feel like it\u2019s all too much? Like the game is rigged from the start? Your &quot;manager&quot; is lording over you for being three minutes late, your job is a cycle of mindless tasks, and life is slipping through your fingers. <strong>Welcome to your breaking point.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579390/extras/LiveThePsychoticBreak.png?t=1745330316\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Don't Forget to Smile</strong> is a fast-paced survivors-like bullet heaven where you fight through relentless waves of everyday enemies.\u00a0Armed with weapons inspired by - and mocking - industry, health and safety and technology, you\u2019ll gear up, level up and reach your breaking point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579390/extras/Arsenal.png?t=1745330316\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022 10+ Weapons</strong> to unlock, forged from the tools of industry and oppression.<br>\u2022\u00a0<strong>15+ Augments</strong>\u00a0to unlock, infused with industrial tech and medicine.<br>\u2022\u00a0<strong>Upgrade Shop</strong> (No, not real money! No microtransactions here)<br>\u2022\u00a0<strong>Hidden Synergies</strong> between weapons and augments unleash devastating effects.<br>\u2022\u00a0<strong>5+ Levels</strong> depicting the bleak reality we inhabit.<br>\u2022\u00a0<strong>A Satirical Take</strong> on corporate culture, mental health, and the human condition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579390/extras/Therapy.png?t=1745330316\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work your way up and out of the corporate ladder, smearing your oppressors across the screen as you shoot, stun, electrify, burn, explode, slap and squash your way to the good life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All brought to life through <strong>a unique blend of hand-drawn artwork, 3D renders, and 2D animation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579390/extras/ActiveDevelopment.png?t=1745330316\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022 Steam Achievements - Framework built, ready to hook to Steam.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022 Controller Support - Now Implemented</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022<strong> Localisations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022 Leaderboards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2022 More Weapons &amp; Augments - Got an idea? Tell us!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579390/extras/JoinTheCause.png?t=1745330316\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want in early? <strong>Join the rebellion.</strong> Get involved with private playtesting and discussions by reaching out to our social channels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579390/extras/devNOtes.png?t=1745330316\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hello! I'm Jamie and I am a solo dev - along with my trusty sound guy Frank, of course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We're working on this in our spare time, alongside family and work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We're committed to releasing a game that you enjoy. Not a cash grab, not a buggy mess, and not rushed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your following, wishlisting and sharing of this game is greatly appreciated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks.</p>","developers":["Existerror Digital"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579390/bfa2c3289d82982ff2f5c97f786b3a0de8ffc791/header.jpg?t=1745330316","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257126317,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126317/movie480.mp4?t=1744740466","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126317/movie_max.mp4?t=1744740466"},"name":"DFTS Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257126317/8e5663324f9ca0f1c1066ad95668f91e83336122/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744740466","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126317/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744740466","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257126317/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744740466"}}],"name":"Don't Forget to Smile","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> No VR<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Additional testing needed to confirm</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> No VR</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Existerror Digital"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia Extrema\nTemas sens\u00edveis\nDrogas il\u00edcitas","rating":"18","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"18","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt\nDrogen\nDerbe Sprache","rating":"18","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"18","use_age_gate":